        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "Data on postoperative RV function was available in 158 out of 161 patients. Thirty-eight patients (24%) developed RV failure. In the lower tertile group, 18.9% developed postoperative RV failure, in the middle group 24.5% and in the upper tertile group 28.8%; this was not statistically different (p = 0.48) (Table 3).",
