        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "The mean period of ventilation post transplant was 302.7 h (SD 617.8), median 102 h (IQR298). On Spearman's rank correlation, this was not associated with the donor/recipient weight ratio (Fig. 3) (p = -0.12, p = 0.14). Even when excluding the 11 patients who had been intubated for more than 100 h, there was no association (p = -0.10, p = 0.38) (Fig. 4).",
          "block_bbox": [
            1305,
            2003,
            2345,
            2279
