              2279.0
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "The mean period of ITU stay was 448 h (SD 749.2), median 184 h (IQR374). On Spearman's rank correlation, this was also not related to the weight ratio (p = -0.04, p = 0.58) (Fig. 5). Again, if the six patients who were in the ITU for more than 2000 h were excluded, there was still no association (p < 0.01, p = 0.98).",
